SUMMARY:The Saturday Night Dinner\, Live Music\, Dance and FIFA Quarter Fi
 nals Party! 
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 \\*Kindly read carefully\\*\n\nJoin me on **Saturday\, July 11th starting 
 at 7:00 pm** for **The Saturday Night Dinner\, Live Music\, Dance and FIFA
  Quarter Finals Party!** It’s going to be a fun\, relaxed evening where 
 great food\, good company\, live music\, dancing\, and the excitement of t
 he FIFA Quarter Finals all come together in one place. Whether you’re co
 ming to enjoy dinner\, cheer on your favorite team\, hit the dance floor\,
  or simply meet some new people and have a great night out\, everyone is w
 elcome. I’m looking forward to bringing people together for an evening o
 f laughter\, conversation\, entertainment\, and unforgettable memories. Ho
 pe to see you there!\n\n-Reserved seating\, friendly people\, good convers
 ation and great food awaits!\n\n*\\*Joined by my other social groups too s
 o we can anticipate a fabulous turn out!*\n\n**Date:** Saturday July 11th\
 n**Arrival Time:** Please arrive between 7:00 pm -9:00 pm (If you can) (As
 k for Steve from Meetup when you arrive- you will be paying me directly no
 t the greeter at the front door)\n**Where to Meet us?**\n**Location:** Smo
 ke Show\n**Address:** 744 Mt. Pleasant\n**Free Parking:** in Residential a
 rea and on Eglinton and Mt. Pleasant north of Eglinton\n**Eglinton and Mt.
  Pleasant Subway:** (Very close\, 1 minute walking distance)\n\nEvent Deta
 ils Bellow:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\nEvent De
 tails:\n**The Saturday Night Dinner\, Live Music\, Dance and FIFA FINALS P
 ARTY!**\n\nJoin us for a fun-filled Saturday evening featuring great food\
 , live music\, dancing\, exciting FIFA Quarter Finals action\, and the cha
 nce to meet new friends in a welcoming atmosphere.\n\n**Event Highlights**
 \n· Enjoy dinner and great conversation with a friendly group\n· Listen 
 to live music and dance the night away\n· Watch the FIFA Quarter Finals w
 ith fellow soccer fans\n· Meet new people and enjoy a relaxed\, social ev
 ening full of fun and laughter\n\n**Event Fee:**\n10 dollars (cash only pl
 ease) (HST included) (Ask for Steve when you arrive- as you will be paying
  me not the greeter at the door)\nor in advance by e transfer to **[stevef
 lemming11@gmail.com](http://steveflemming11@gmail.com/)**\n\n\\*No extra c
 harge for those attending my Bowling event prior to the Dinner Party!\n\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Friendly Reminder:**\n\\*One beverage
  or appetizer minimum to support the venue and servers- this is greatly ap
 preciated :)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
