SUMMARY:The Wednesday Night Poker\, Euchre and Pool with Friends!
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Looking for a fun and relaxed evening with good people? Come join me\, Ste
 ve Flemming\, for a casual games night featuring poker\, euchre\, cards\, 
 and pool. Whether you're a seasoned player or just looking to learn\, ever
 yone is welcome. This isn't about high stakes or intense competition—it'
 s about enjoying great conversation\, sharing a few laughs\, meeting new f
 riends\, and spending time together in a friendly\, respectful atmosphere.
  Bring your sense of humor\, your favorite card-playing strategies\, and g
 et ready for an enjoyable night of games and community. I look forward to 
 seeing you around the table!\n\n-Reserved seating\, friendly people\, good
  conversation and great food awaits!\n\n*\\*Joined by my other social grou
 ps too so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out!*\n\n**Date:** Wednesday J
 uly 15th\n**Arrival Time:** Please arrive between 6:00 pm -7:30 pm (If you
  can)\n(Ask for Steve from Meetup when you arrive or look for us in our re
 served section.\n**Where to Meet us?**\n**Location:** Smoke Show\n**Addres
 s:** 744 Mt. Pleasant\n**Free Parking:** in Residential area and on Eglint
 on and Mt. Pleasant north of Eglinton\n**Eglinton and Mt. Pleasant Subway:
 ** (Very close\, 1 minute walking distance)\n\nEvent Details Bellow:\n\nSi
 ncerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\nEvent Details:\n**The Wed
 nesday Night Poker\, Euchre and Pool with Friends!**\n\nJoin us for a rela
 xed and enjoyable evening of poker\, euchre\, pool\, great conversation\, 
 and the opportunity to meet new friends in a fun\, welcoming atmosphere.\n
 \n**Event Highlights**\n· Play poker\, euchre\, and other card games—wh
 ether you're experienced or just learning\n· Enjoy a few friendly games o
 f pool while relaxing and getting to know new people\n· Meet new friends\
 , share some laughs\, and spend the evening in a respectful\, low-pressure
  social setting\n\n**Event Fee:**\n5 dollars (if you arrive between 6:00 p
 m and 6:50 pm\n(cash only please) (HST included)\n10 dollars if you arrive
  after 6:51 pm\nor in advance by e transfer to **[steveflemming11@gmail.co
 m](http://steveflemming11@gmail.com/)**\n\n\\*Fee includes optional Karaok
 e later on in the evening\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Friendl
 y Reminder:**\n\\*One beverage or appetizer minimum to support the venue a
 nd servers- this is greatly appreciated :)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-
